  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the roots of the equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "98",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></math>&nbsp;are roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>&nbsp;.......(i)</p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp;are roots of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;.........(ii)</p><p>Given, if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo></math></p><p>So, from equation (i) and (ii) we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo></math>, Now by product of roots we get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>7</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>98</mn></math></p>"
  }
